# review-aspect (bugs perspective) inspects the uncommitted diff and flags the
# planted defects: removed divide-by-zero guard and off-by-one array indexing.
(zero|division|divide|off.by.one|length|bound|index|undefined)
# It identifies a concrete problem.
(bug|issue|error|incorrect|missing|risk)
# Single-perspective reviewer runs zero build/test -> no build-verification section.
!Build [Vv]erification
